      "value": "I've submitted a helpdesk ticket with a crash dump attached.\n\nSDK: 3.10.3\n\nBuild: 1832 (3p-beta branch)\n\nWorth noting that it only crashes when using the VRC Quick Launcher tool; running Build & Test the normal way launches the client successfully.\n\nWhen using the VRC Quick Launcher, it just gets stuck launching the profile:",
