      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "also wanted to add; the Unity error window appears VERY briefly, most of the time I completely miss it. The VRChat application never actually opens. It doesn't seem like a typical crash when VRChat is open; usually when VRChat crashes while running, the Unity error window stays there for a while longer, compared to what's happening here. The crash dumps also seem to be very tiny compared to the usual ones.\n\nIt's a lot easier to see the error window popup when directly using the VRC Quick Launcher to launch a build.",
