      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "wanted to copy some info here that I put in my helpdesk ticket.\n\nI realized the issue only occurs if the VRC Quick Launcher is launched from the VCC, from the Tools tab. If I manually launch the VRCQL (from [VCC install location]\\VRChat Creator Companion\\Tools\\VRC Quick Launcher), then it successfully launches a local test client without crashing.\n\nSee video attached.\n\nSo, possibly something weird going on with how the VCC launches the VRCQL? The crash dumps are still the same as before.\n\nFinally, I double-checked, and this issue does not occur on the live build, it launches normally there. This issue is only happening for me on the 3p-beta and open-beta branches.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
