      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Issue might have been identified!\n\nFor anyone still currently having this issue, VRChat support has opened a test branch on Steam, \"z-test\". The password for it is \"VivaldiMozartBach\".\n\nWhatever changes that were made on this branch have resolved the issue for me. Give it a try if you're still having this problem.",
